      "source": [
        "# Emergency Warning Satellite Service (EWSS) Demonstration\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook demonstrates decoding and analyzing **Emergency Warning Satellite Service (EWSS)** messages transmitted by GNSS / QZSS.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Standards & References:\n",
        "- **EWSS CAMF v1.2**: *Emergency Warning Satellite Service: Common Alert Message Format Specification*, Issue 1.2, March 2026 (European Union / Japan Cabinet Office).\n",
        "  - An interoperable 122-bit alert message format designed for satellite broadcasting (Galileo EWSS, QZSS DCX), aligned with OASIS Common Alerting Protocol (CAP) v1.2.\n",
        "- **IS-QZSS-DCX-003**: *Quasi-Zenith Satellite System Interface Specification - Disaster and Crisis Report Extended Service (DCX)*, March 2025.\n",
        "- **IS-QZSS-DCR-014**: *Quasi-Zenith Satellite System Interface Specification - Disaster and Crisis Report Service (DCR)*, April 2025.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
