        "### EWSS CAMF v1.2 Message Structure (122 bits):\n",
        "| Section | Field | Bits | Description |\n",
        "|---|---|---|---|\n",
        "| **3.1 Message Identifier** | A1: Message Type | 2 | 0: Test, 1: Alert, 2: Update, 3: All Clear |\n",
        "| | A2: Country / Region | 9 | ISO 3166 code (e.g., 0b001101111 = 111 for Japan) |\n",
        "| | A3: Provider Identifier | 5 | Alert provider ID (1: FMMC/L-Alert, 2: FDMA/J-Alert, etc.) |\n",
        "| **3.2 Hazard** | A4: Hazard Category & Type | 7 | 12 categories, 113 types (e.g., 82 = MET - Typhoon) |\n",
        "| | A5: Severity | 2 | 0: Unknown, 1: Moderate, 2: Severe, 3: Extreme |\n",
        "| **3.3 Hazard Chronology** | A6: Onset Week Number | 1 | 0: Current week, 1: Next week |\n",
        "| | A7: Time of Week (TOW) | 14 | 1-min resolution (Mon 00:00 to Sun 23:59 UTC) |\n",
        "| | A8: Hazard Duration | 2 | 0: Unknown, 1: <6h, 2: 6h–12h, 3: 12h–24h |\n",
        "| **3.5 Guidance to React** | A9: Type of Library | 1 | 0: International (EU), 1: National (Japan) |\n",
        "| | A10: Version of Library | 3 | Version ID (#1 to #8) |\n",
        "| | A11: Instruction Library | 10 | Action guidance (List A + List B, or national instruction/info) |\n",
        "| **3.6 Target Area** | A12: Center Latitude | 16 | Semi-major/minor ellipse center [-90°, +90°] (res. ~305m) |\n",
        "| | A13: Center Longitude | 17 | Ellipse center [-180°, +180°] |\n",
        "| | A14: Semi-major Axis ($L_M$) | 5 | Logarithmic scale [0.216 km to 2500 km] (32 steps) |\n",
        "| | A15: Semi-minor Axis ($L_m$) | 5 | Logarithmic scale [0.216 km to 2500 km] (32 steps) |\n",
        "| | A16: Azimuth Angle ($\\lambda$) | 6 | Orientation [-90°, +90°] (step ~2.8125°) |\n",
        "| **3.7 Main Subject / Specific** | A17: Main Subject | 2 | 0: Refined Ellipse (B1), 1: Center of Hazard (B2), 2: 2nd Ellipse (B3), 3: Detailed Hazard Info (B4) |\n",
        "| | Detailed Settings | 15 | Specific parameters (e.g., B4: D1–D36 quantitative values) |\n",
        "\n",
        "### QZSS DCX (MT44) Payload Bit Layout (212 bits):\n",
        "- `bit 0–13` (14 bits): L1S header\n",
        "- `bit 14–23` (10 bits): `SDMT` (1 bit, 0: DCX) + `SDM` (9 bits, Sub-Delivery Mode / Disaster Category)\n",
        "- `bit 24–145` (122 bits): **CAMF Core Alert Message** (EWSS CAMF v1.2)\n",
        "- `bit 146–211` (66 bits): **DCX Extended Message** (`DCX-ext`, municipality codes JIS X0402, extra guidance)\n"
      ]
